{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Paint the Snow \u2013 Idle</i></strong> is an engaging idle game set in a colorful, cartoonish winter world. Manage resources, automate processes, and balance mining with battles to keep your world growing\u2014even when you\u2019re away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining and Meeples</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the meeples - adorable little buckets that gather resources and pave the way for automation. Every meeple tries their best to keep things running smoothly and efficiently. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/5a1593b484f0ebcc68779ab973a47607.poster.avif?t=1755863415\" width=684 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/5a1593b484f0ebcc68779ab973a47607.webm?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/5a1593b484f0ebcc68779ab973a47607.mp4?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Spirits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spirits - your allies in battles against waves of monsters. Each spirit is a unique tool for defeating enemies, with multiple stages of evolution. Upgrade them, unlock new forms and abilities to become even more powerful! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/56d7062d23a26f8cea43949297ef47b1.poster.avif?t=1755863415\" width=610 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/56d7062d23a26f8cea43949297ef47b1.webm?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/56d7062d23a26f8cea43949297ef47b1.mp4?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each part of the game can be expanded and upgraded, so take advantage of it! Unlock new systems with numerous unique upgrades and strategic possibilities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/470d90cd6f88dc1a67e67eaef2dde257.poster.avif?t=1755863415\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/470d90cd6f88dc1a67e67eaef2dde257.webm?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/470d90cd6f88dc1a67e67eaef2dde257.mp4?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feeling lucky?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speed up your progress with the slot machine, where generous bonuses await!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/99fcc1798c1c41f713f0bde88996d769.poster.avif?t=1755863415\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/99fcc1798c1c41f713f0bde88996d769.webm?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/99fcc1798c1c41f713f0bde88996d769.mp4?t=1755863415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I\u2019m new here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854660/2f23e2a16e512a723072be320e54a64477c1924d.jpg"},{"name":"Luck in my veins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst